[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12084.389, "timestamp": "03:21:24", "text": "それでも私の裏切りはブーブー。あなたは誰？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12086.389, "timestamp": "03:21:26", "text": "待って、Wi-Fiを使っているのは私だけ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12088.389, "timestamp": "03:21:28", "text": "。待って、携帯を切断させて"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12091.429, "timestamp": "03:21:31", "text": "。インターネットが使えるかもしれない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12093.59, "timestamp": "03:21:33", "text": "タブーン。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12098.79, "timestamp": "03:21:38", "text": "いや、リソースマネージャーを見せて。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12100.389, "timestamp": "03:21:40", "text": "えーと、他に何かあるはずは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12102.55, "timestamp": "03:21:42", "text": "ない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12105.91, "timestamp": "03:21:45", "text": "待って、Epic Games。閉じさせて。Fortnite"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12108.71, "timestamp": "03:21:48", "text": "とかだったらどうなるか想像してみて。オーケー。ああ。ふむ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12111.349, "timestamp": "03:21:51", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12114.63, "timestamp": "03:21:54", "text": "えーと、Steamはバックグラウンドで何もダウンロードしていない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12116.95, "timestamp": "03:21:56", "text": "。じゃあ"}]